<title>AUSTRALIA: Boral sells tyre distribution to Michelin.</title>
<headline>Boral sells tyre distribution to Michelin.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian building products and energy group Botal Ltd on Wednesday said it would sell its tyre wharehousing and distribution business to French tyre-maker Michelin.</p>
<p>Boral did not disclose the sale price.  </p>
<p>But Boral said the sale of stock and assets, combined with reductions in working capital, would realise over A$50 million and more than halve its investment in tyre operations.</p>
</text>
